From 9a4bd0f2941f0d7b84e3bd24936e4cbe9d799405 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MinsOS <minsos@localhost>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:59:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Use Face HIDL 2.0 for the unguarded V3_0 casts

The y2q vendor ships only face@2.0, so unica/patches/legacy deletes the V3_0
ISehBiometricsFace classes. Its 0001 fallback patch no longer applies to this
donor, which leaves seven check-casts to V3_0 that the
MANUFACTURING_TYPE=jdm switch does not gate. Face enrollment then kills
system_server (NoClassDefFoundError in SemFaceServiceExImpl.daemonSetRotation).

Cast those sites to V2_0 and give the V2_0 proxy the seven @2.0 methods R8
dropped from it, copied from the donor V3_0 proxy (same @2.0 descriptor and
transaction codes as the stock SM-G986N A13 proxy).

diff --git a/smali/com/android/server/biometrics/sensors/face/FaceService$FaceServiceWrapper.smali b/smali/com/android/server/biometrics/sensors/face/FaceService$FaceServiceWrapper.smali
